                                "sense_id": "88de4546-5df2-38c3-a5f4-6e30120e4100",
                                "text": "And then, upon this thoroughly baseless assumption, the critic proceeds to read all of us a lecture upon our sacrilegious symbolatry, and the dreadful abyss into which we are hurrying with fatal velocity."
                            },
