                                "sense_id": "88de4546-5df2-38c3-a5f4-6e30120e4100",
                                "text": "The soulful intensity of her lamentation can be best understood if we remember that in Hindu symbolatry the blue colour, which goes with the sky and the sea, is attributed to Infinity."
